        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c18eb82a6a104abe8922bf88020f0470",
      "statement": "ADR-0025 removed every rank-0-only validation gate (the FID cadence gate is rank-symmetric and the GRPO validation step runs on all ranks), so the configured `val/fid`, `val/x0_mae`, and `val/mean_reward` monitors stay global under DDP and best-by-metric checkpoint selection works again under multi-GPU.",
