      "statement": "Production validation is refused without a held-out source: the JiT shell disables validation and falls back to periodic/last checkpointing when no held-out split is wired, and the supervised ControlNet path raises unless `val_data_base_dir` is a BraTS directory or `val_fraction > 0` (the recipe default is `0.2`).",
