      "statement": "Evaluation decodes in float32 with the MAISI `norm_float16` flag disabled, and paired scoring applies the same per-volume `min_max_to_unit` convention as the ControlNet pipeline with `data_range=1.0`, so the in-training monitor curve and the offline before/after number stay directly comparable.",
