      "id": "claim_fa5f03fab5bb4180964ae8bce7ef7e20",
      "statement": "`--callbacks` (or the YAML `callbacks:` list) replaces the callback name list rather than extending it, so an operator override on the supervised path silently drops the default-on `paired_fidelity` observer; dropping `checkpoint` as well makes `TrainingSpine.run` fail fast because a `ModelCheckpoint` is required.",
