    {
      "id": "claim_8861d6cdc22b4e1793ec3349d7377568",
      "statement": "The in-training paired-fidelity observer has two focused test anchors: `tests/test_paired_fidelity_callback.py` asserts the monitor wiring externally (logged metrics, cadence gate, fixed-subset stability, same-seed determinism, per-epoch reset, `[0, 1]` normalization ceiling, shape-mismatch error, observe-only contract), and `tests/test_paired_fidelity_ddp.py` asserts 2-rank no-deadlock behavior plus cross-rank consistency of both the logged and the rank-local pre-sync scores while the checkpoint keeps monitoring `val/x0_mae`.",
